# Data. Raw and processed datasets are regenerated in seconds by
# run_pipeline.py, so they are not versioned; the evaluation artifacts under
# data/results/ ARE versioned, because they are the evidence the write-up
# cites and a reader must be able to check them without re-training.
data/raw/
data/processed/

# Model artifacts (large, and rebuilt by re-running the pipeline)
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.pickle

